cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "LLM-Based Curriculum Analyzer (2025)"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Aravind
    family-names: Sathesh
repository-code: "https://github.com/Aravind-Sathesh/LLM-Based-Curriculum-Analyzer"
license: Apache-2.0
date-released: 2025-12-17
abstract: >-
  A deterministic Streamlit tool for analysing the alignment between a course
  handout and its question papers, by topic coverage and Bloom's taxonomy level:
  coordinate-based PDF parsing, OCR, a spaCy Bloom classifier and Sentence-BERT
  matching. Archived in 2026 and superseded by a knowledge-graph pipeline.
